@conversation index id=cvn_qxfOhN chapter=Prologue title="A Quiet Evening" checkpoint
@scene VN day=0 time=21:00 bg=bg_sitting_room.png music=sunny.mp3 textbox=nvl

+persistent.runs

narration
  en: A quiet evening at Nora's place.
narration
  en: Your phone has been buzzing all day.{w=500} All of it to your {i}old{/i} number.
narration
  en: You switched numbers a week ago.{w} Whoever is texting doesn't know that.

stage
  textbox adv
  show nora:smile center transition=slide_up duration=700

nora:smile [center] voice=vo_nora_01.mp3
  en: Hey! You're finally here.

input NAME default=Alex by=nora
  en: Nora squints at you. "Remind me, what should I call you?"

nora:smile
  en: Nice to e-meet you {{NAME}} 🙏 ...kidding. Sit down.
nora:frown [if persistent.runs > 1]
  en: ...Weird. I feel like we've done this before. Run number {{persistent.runs}}?

nora:open
  en: So you got a new number, but someone keeps texting the old one?

choice CURIOSITY by=nora label=ask
  en: "Are you going to check it?"
? Yeah, let me look.
  value eager
  +curiosity 5
  -> day1
? Nah. {i}Probably{/i} spam.
  value wary
? Who had this number before you? [once]
  value asked
  -> #old_number

stage [if CURIOSITY == 'wary']
  background bg_sitting_room_night.png transition=fade_black duration=1.4s
  music none fade=2s
  ambience night_ambience.mp3 fade=3s
  move nora left duration=800

nora:frown voice=vo_nora_02.mp3 [if CURIOSITY == 'wary']
  en: Your phone is buzzing again.{w=400} You should {i}really{/i} look.

call shared#phone_buzz
wait 1.5s
  en: New message from an unknown number

branch
  -> day1

nora:frown label=old_number
  en: No idea.{w} The shop said it was {i}"recently freed up"{/i}. {shake}Creepy{/shake}, right?
call shared#phone_buzz
nora
  en: ...See? It's doing it again.
-> #ask
